# Digests of every shipped file in KingKlaw's admission member.
#
# The Ada sources are VENDORED copies of immutable wu round outputs, carrying
# a licence comment block added by ada-factory scripts/stamp-licence.sh. Both
# digests are recorded below so the derivation can be checked by anyone:
#   stamped = stamp-licence(unstamped)
# and each file also carries its own unstamped sha256 in its header. The
# unstamped digests are what the proof, the ledger entry and the off-seat
# admission signature refer to. The stamp is comments only; PROVE.txt is the
# re-prove OF THE STAMPED SOURCES and matches the pre-stamp run exactly
# (27 checks, 13 functional contracts, 14 termination, 0 unproved).
#
# Verify shipped files:   shasum -a256 -c DIGESTS.sha256

